<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24655" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαγρᾰφ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>delineation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				501a
			</span></i>; <i>diagram,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Phil.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δ. τῶν φύλλων</span>”
				<i>outline,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.13.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>delimitation</i> of land, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.40.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>: in pl., <i>plans, specifications</i> of a
			building, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				46.3
			</span></i> (Halic.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>outline, scheme,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς δ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					105b13
				</span></i>
			; <i>table, syllabus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1107a33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EE</u>
				1228a28
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπογραφή</span>);
				<i>description</i> of goods sold, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTheb.Bank</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>; <i>register,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπάντων τῶν γενῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					43.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3060
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Teos</span>), etc.; <i>list</i> of
			articles, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				3924.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>decree, ordinance,</i> esp. of Alexander, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(2).526.35
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ περὶ τῶν ἱερῶν δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>crossing out, cancelling,</i> of a debt: hence, <i>payment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖν τὴν δ. τινὶ τῶν εἴκοσι πέντε
					ταλάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					31.27.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				121.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, al.; <i>payment by draft</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				742.52
			</span></i> (Ephesus, pl.); <i>certificate that such payment has been
				made</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				281.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>contract,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				88.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			<i>levy, tax,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				131.5
			</span></i>, al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
